id: studied-lord
name: Studied Lord
order: 18
description: >
  Not only are your fighting skills and your evolution superior to your foes’, but so is your intellect.
text: >
  Studied Lord: Not only are your fighting skills and your evolution superior to your foes’, but so is your intellect.
  (1)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Analysis Maneuver. If you already had access to the Analysis Maneuver, increase your Scholarship Modifier by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Analysis Maneuver, gain a stack of Overwhelm.

---

# (1) Already had it: opened by anything but this - the Investigation Skill's Ranks (conditions.mjs accessElsewhere).
[passive]
allow maneuver.analysis;
if (accessElsewhere("analysis")) {
    scholarship.mod += 1(T);
}

# (2) The Analysis Maneuver declared: a stack of Overwhelm, once a Round. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic
# button; set Triggered, asked in the window as it is declared.
[triggered/declare-maneuver, toggle, 1/round, effect 2]
requires using("analysis");
overwhelm.stacks += 1;
